K6M4Ae8y-","number":29,"title":"Collab: Nod.ai","description":"Milestone to track IREE + Nod.ai bugs and model progress","creator":{"login":"allieculp","id":60522369,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNTIyMzY5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60522369?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allieculp","html_url":"https://github.com/allieculp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allieculp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allieculp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allieculp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allieculp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allieculp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allieculp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allieculp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allieculp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allieculp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":21,"closed_issues":84,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-06-22T20:21:40Z","updated_at":"2025-07-28T22:53:20Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":22,"created_at":"2023-03-17T06:50:28Z","updated_at":"2023-03-29T18:32:59Z","closed_at":"2023-03-29T18:32:59Z","assignee":{"login":"antiagainst","id":487928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NzkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/487928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/antiagainst","html_url":"https://github.com/antiagainst","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antiagainst/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antiagainst/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antiagainst/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antiagainst/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antiagainst/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antiagainst/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antiagainst/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antiagainst/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antiagainst/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### What happened?\r\n\r\nUnet failed on some AMD rdna2/rdna3 and nvidia A100 devices, with error:\r\n```\r\n<vm>:0: OK; failed to wait on timepoint; \r\n[ 0] bytecode module.forward:131934 [\r\n    <eval_with_key>.9:5042:14,\r\n    <eval_with_key>.9:5039:15,\r\n    <eval_with_key>.9:5038:15,\r\n```\r\nHowever, all the dumped dispatches ran without any problem.\r\n\r\n### Version information\r\n\r\n1. Download the latest [Unet model](https://storage.googleapis.com/shark-public/vivian/unet_1_64_512_512_fp16_stable-diffusion-2-1-base_vulkan_torch.mlir)\r\n2. Compile command for Vulkan\r\n```iree-compile --iree-input-type=none --iree-hal-target-backends=vulkan --iree-stream-resource-index-bits=64 --iree-vm-target-index-bits=64 --iree-util-zero-fill-elided-attrs -iree-vulkan-target-triple=rdna2-7900-linux --iree-preprocessing-pass-pipeline='builtin.module(func.func(iree-flow-detach-elementwise-from-named-ops,iree-flow-convert-1x1-filter-conv2d-to-matmul,iree-preprocessing-convert-conv2d-to-img2col,iree-preprocessing-pad-linalg-ops{pad-size=32}))' unet_1_64_512_512_fp16_stable-diffusion-2-1-base_vulkan/unet_1_64_512_512_fp16_stable-diffusion-2-1-base_vulkan_torch.mlir -o unet.vmfb```\r\n3. Benchmark command for Vulkan\r\n```iree-benchmark-module --module=unet.vmfb --function=forward --device=vulkan --input=1x4x64x64xf16 --input=1xf16 --input=2x64x1024xf16 --input=f32=1.0```\r\n\r\n\r\n### Additional context\r\n\r\nAlso failed on A100, commands for cuda path are as following:\r\n```iree-compile --iree-input-type=none --iree-vm-bytecode-module-output-format=flatbuffer-binary --iree-hal-target-backends=cuda --iree-llvmcpu-target-cpu-features=host --iree-hal-cuda-disable-loop-nounroll-wa --iree-hal-cuda-llvm-target-arch=sm_80 --iree-stream-resource-index-bits=64 --iree-vm-target-index-bits=64 --iree-util-zero-fill-elided-attrs --iree-preprocessing-pass-pipeline='builtin.module(func.func(iree-flow-detach-elementwise-from-named-ops,iree-flow-convert-1x1-filter-conv2d-to-matmul,iree-preprocessing-convert-conv2d-to-img2col,iree-preprocessing-pad-linalg-ops{pad-size=32}))' unet_1_64_512_512_fp16_stable-diffusion-2-1-base_cuda/unet_1_64_512_512_fp16_stable-diffusion-2-1-base_cuda_torch.mlir -o unet.vmfb```\r\n\r\n```iree-benchmark-module --module=unet.vmfb --device=cuda --function=forward --input=1x4x64x64xf16 --input=1xf16 --input=2x64x1024xf16 --input=f32=1.0 ```","closed_by":{"login":"antiagainst","id":487928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NzkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/487928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/antiagainst","html_url":"https://github.com/antiagainst","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antiagainst/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antiagainst/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antiagainst/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antiagainst/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antiagainst/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antiagainst/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antiagainst/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antiagainst/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antiagainst/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https